WEBVTT

00:18:58.076 --> 00:19:00.516
For inaction regrets, it is harder.

00:19:00.516 --> 00:19:03.676
And so the key here
on the opportunities lost

00:19:03.676 --> 00:19:06.716
is to think about,

00:19:06.716 --> 00:19:09.236
you know, really like,
what are you going to do?

00:19:09.276 --> 00:19:12.036
You sort of reduce
the level of abstraction and say,

00:19:12.076 --> 00:19:14.116
"What are you going to do next time?"

00:19:14.156 --> 00:19:18.516
Not an abstraction of like,
"Oh, I'm going to be more bold."

00:19:18.516 --> 00:19:20.676
It's like, what are you
going to do next time?

00:19:20.716 --> 00:19:22.836
This is what we were talking
about with Lily.

00:19:22.836 --> 00:19:24.556
What are you going to do next time?

00:19:24.556 --> 00:19:26.316
All regrets begin at the juncture.

00:19:26.356 --> 00:19:28.356
You can go this way
or you can go that way.

00:19:28.356 --> 00:19:32.876
And so for Claudia, I would say,
the next time you're at this juncture,